{"title":"Career Roadmap · Concept Artist","role":"Concept Artist","summary":"A Concept Artist develops the visual ideas that guide the creation of characters, environments, creatures, props, vehicles, worlds, and visual styles for games, animation, films, VFX, and other entertainment projects. The role combines drawing, visual storytelling, design thinking, anatomy, perspective, colour, 3D workflows, and increasingly AI-assisted ideation.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Des (Bachelor of Design)","Course":"Animation & Game Design"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Approx. Timeline","Target"],"rows":[[{"text":"Foundation"},{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Drawing, design fundamentals, visual language"}],[{"text":"Exploration"},{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Character, environment and prop design"}],[{"text":"Specialisation"},{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Digital painting + 3D-assisted concept workflows"}],[{"text":"Industry Preparation"},{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Portfolio + internship + production projects"}],[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"0–2 years"},{"text":"Junior Concept Artist"}],[{"text":"Growth"},{"text":"3–6 years"},{"text":"Concept Artist"}],[{"text":"Mid Career"},{"text":"6–10 years"},{"text":"Senior Concept Artist"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"10–15 years"},{"text":"Lead Concept Artist / Art Lead"}],[{"text":"Long-term"},{"text":"15+ years"},{"text":"Art Director / Creative Director"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Drawing & Visual Foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Build strong fundamentals before specialising."},{"type":"h","text":"Drawing"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Line quality"},{"text":"Shape"},{"text":"Form"},{"text":"Perspective"},{"text":"Proportion"},{"text":"Composition"},{"text":"Light and shadow"},{"text":"Value"},{"text":"Gesture drawing"}]},{"type":