:"Previsualisation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"However, professional concept art still requires human ability to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Understand the brief"},{"text":"Make design decisions"},{"text":"Maintain visual consistency"},{"text":"Understand anatomy"},{"text":"Design functional objects"},{"text":"Work within production constraints"},{"text":"Respond to art direction"},{"text":"Create original visual solutions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI-assisted workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Creative Brief","Human Research","AI-Assisted Exploration","Human Selection","Drawing / 3D Development","Design Refinement","Art Direction Review","Final Concept"]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest future profile is not simply \"artist who uses AI.\""},{"type":"p","text":"It is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Artist","Designer","3D Generalist","Visual Storyteller","AI-Assisted Ideator"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Copyright, Originality & Professional Practice","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Concept artists should develop strong habits around:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Original design"},{"text":"Reference attribution where appropriate"},{"text":"Licensed assets"},{"text":"Production confidentiality"},{"text":"Client ownership"},{"text":"NDA compliance"},{"text":"Responsible AI use"}]},{"type":"p","text":"When using generative AI in professional work, the artist should understand the studio's policies regarding training data, client confidentiality, asset ownership, disclosure and commercial usage."}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Relevant postgraduate areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Concept Art"},{"text":"Game Art"},{"text":"Animation"},{"text":"Visual Development"},{"text":"Illustration"},{"text":"Entertainment Design"},{"text":"Digital Art"},{"text":"VFX"},{"text":"Character Design"},{"text":"Environment Design"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential international roles:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"t