 storytelling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Concept Design"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Character design"},{"text":"Environment design"},{"text":"Prop design"},{"text":"Creature design"},{"text":"Vehicle design"},{"text":"World-building"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Photoshop/Krita"},{"text":"Procreate"},{"text":"Illustrator"},{"text":"Blender"},{"text":"ZBrush"},{"text":"Substance 3D"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Game/Animation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Unreal Engine"},{"text":"Unity"},{"text":"Animation principles"},{"text":"Game design fundamentals"},{"text":"Visual development"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Art direction"},{"text":"Brief interpretation"},{"text":"Fast ideation"},{"text":"Feedback handling"},{"text":"Production documentation"},{"text":"Team collaboration"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Generative AI"},{"text":"Procedural generation"},{"text":"Virtual production"},{"text":"Real-time rendering"},{"text":"AI-assisted visual development"}]}]},{"heading":"Target Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["B.Des Animation & Game Design","Concept Art Internship","Junior Concept Artist","Concept Artist","Senior Concept Artist","Lead Concept Artist","Art Lead","Art Director","Creative Director"]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Profile by Graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong graduate targeting Concept Art should have:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"B.Des Animation & Game Design"},{"text":"Strong drawing and perspective fundamentals"},{"text":"Strong anatomy knowledge"},{"text":"Character-design portfolio"},{"text":"Environment-design portfolio"},{"text":"Prop/creature design experience"},{"text":"Digital painting proficiency"},{"text":"Blender/3D blockout capability"},{"text":"Unreal Engine familiarity"},{"text":"4–6 polished concept-art projects"},{"text":"At least one complete visual-development project"},{"text":"St